    <string name="pad_warning_title">重置计数器并不能清洁废墨垫</string>
    <string name="pad_warning_body">计数器是电子记录，废墨垫是物理部件。在重置前请清洗、更换废墨垫或外接废墨瓶，否则废墨最终会溢出到打印机内部。</string>

    <!-- Shown in place of the counters when the connected printer keeps its
         waste ink counter somewhere the app cannot write to. Deliberately does
         not claim to know which of the two causes applies: the catalog can tell
         that a model has no counter, but not whether that is a maintenance box
         or a gap in the database. The dialog explains both. -->
    <string name="waste_unsupported_title">该型号没有可重置的废墨计数器</string>
    <string name="waste_unsupported_body">此打印机没有本应用可重置的废墨计数器。设备未发生故障，应用与打印机均正常。</string>
    <string name="action_more_info">更多信息</string>
    <!-- A printer that answered, but is not in the catalog. Not the same as
         waste_unsupported: that one means the catalog knows there is nothing
         to reset. This one means we do not have a verified profile, so we
         must not claim the printer has no counter. -->
    <string name="partial_session_title">已连接，但无已验证的配置文件</string>
    <string name="partial_session_body">可查看状态和墨水余量。在应用收录已验证的配置文件之前，无法读取或重置废墨计数器。您可以提交型号适配请求；无需等待收录即可查看当前读数。</string>
    <string name="partial_cleaning_note">打印头清洗会消耗墨水并增加废墨计数。由于缺少已验证的配置文件，本应用无法重置该打印机的计数器。</string>
    <string name="error_power_clean_unverified">未收录验证配置文件时无法使用深度清洗。深度清洗消耗大量墨水，且本应用无法重置该废墨计数。</string>

    <!-- Shown next to a counter whose ceiling the model does not publish, which
         is every model sourced from reinkpy. Without a ceiling there is no
         percentage, and the raw value is what the printer actually reports. -->
    <string name="waste_scale_unknown">无百分比：此型号未公开计数器上限值。上方显示为原始读数。</string>
    <!-- Reset dialog body for those same models. There is no percentage field
         and no per-counter choice, because the reset covers every address the
         model publishes. -->
    <string name="dialog_reset_model_values">该型号未公开计数器上限，因此没有目标百分比。重置操作将向该型号公开的所有地址写入默认值。</string>

    <!-- The EEPROM backup taken before any write. Shown after the write, whether
         it succeeded or was refused partway through. -->
    <string name="section_waste_backup">写入前备份</string>
    <string name="waste_backup_note">写入前这些地址保存的原始值。请保存一份备份，以便出现异常时进行恢复。</string>
    <string name="action_copy_backup">复制备份</string>
    <string name="backup_copied">备份已复制</string>
    <!-- Write-path failures. The first pair means nothing was written at all;
         the second means the printer refused partway through. -->
    <string name="error_backup_failed">无法读取当前数值，未执行任何写入。应用在写入前必须先备份。</string>
    <string name="error_backup_failed_at">无法读取 %1$s 处的当前数值，未执行任何写入。应用在写入前必须先备份。</string>
    <string name="error_write_rejected">打印机拒绝写入。未执行进一步写入。</string>
    <string name="error_write_rejected_at">打印机在 %1$s 处拒绝写入。已有 %2$d 个地址写入完成；未再写入后续内容。备份见下方。</string>

    <!-- Restoring a saved backup.
         The backup is saved by the app before every write, so the case this
         covers is the one where the mistake is noticed later - usually with the
         app already closed. That is why it is automatic and why it is kept on
         disk, and the wording says so rather than presenting a button.
         Restoring raises the counters, which is the opposite of a reset, so the
         dialog says that plainly instead of leaving it to be discovered. -->
    <string name="section_restore_backup">还原备份</string>
    <string name="restore_note">每次写入前均会自动保存备份。您可以选择一份备份还原数值，或粘贴之前保存的备份文本。</string>
    <string name="restore_no_history">暂无保存的备份。每次写入前均会自动保存一次备份。</string>
    <string name="action_restore_selected">还原选中的备份</string>
    <string name="action_restore_paste">从粘贴的文本还原</string>
    <string name="restore_record_label">%1$s — %2$s</string>
    <string name="restore_unknown_model">未知型号</string>
    <!-- Which write found the state a saved record holds, and what it reads.
         Two records can look identical by model and time, so without these the
         list gives no way to tell which one undoes the mistake. The "unknown"
         wording covers records saved before the origin was recorded at all. -->
    <string name="restore_origin_reset">重置前保存</string>
    <string name="restore_origin_restore">还原前保存</string>
    <string name="restore_origin_unknown">写入前保存</string>
    <string name="restore_record_detail">%1$s · %2$s</string>
    <string name="restore_record_reads">读取值 %1$s</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_title">还原此备份？</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_body">此操作将写回之前记录的数值。这会增加计数器读数（与重置相反）。仅在撤销错误操作时使用。</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_model">备份来源型号：%1$s</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_no_model">此备份中未指明打印机型号。请确保它来自当前打印机。</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_addresses">将写入 %1$d 个地址。</string>
    <string name="dialog_restore_counter_delta">%1$s：%2$s → %3$s</string>
    <string name="action_restore">还原</string>
    <string name="dialog_paste_backup_title">粘贴备份</string>
    <string name="field_paste_backup">备份文本</string>
    <string name="paste_backup_hint">粘贴您先前复制的备份文本，可带或不带标题行。</string>
    <string name="paste_backup_invalid">未找到有效的备份行。请粘贴应用生成的文本，或至少包含形如 \'0x001C = 0x3F\' 的行。</string>
    <string name="paste_backup_parsed">已找到 %1$d 个地址。</string>
